'''KSFI''' (100.3 [[FM broadcasting|FM]]) is a radio station in [[Salt Lake City|Salt Lake City, Utah]], United States. KSFI maintains studio facilities located at the KSL Broadcast House building in Salt Lake City's [[Triad Center]] (which also house [[KRSP-FM]] and the [[KSL (radio)|KSL-AM-FM]]-[[KSL-TV|TV]] partners), and its transmitter is located on [[Farnsworth Peak]] in the [[Oquirrh Mountains]], southwest of Salt Lake City.

